/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (Orienteering is a sport that combines navigation, map reading, and outdoor adventure. The goal is to use a detailed map and compass to find a series of marked locations, called controls, in the correct order.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
